{"title": "Engraved Pin", "pageid": 25396, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Engraved_Pin", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items", "Harpers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png/300px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f0/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Engraved Pin image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png/300px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Engraved Pin</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item found in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a>. It is the calling card of a <a href=\"/wiki/Harpers\" title=\"Harpers\">Harper</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A small but detailed pin, depicting a harp offset against a crescent moon.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>On the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jhaam\" title=\"Jhaam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/25px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/38px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/50px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jhaam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/25px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jhaam\" title=\"Jhaam\">Jhaam</a> an executed <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">drow</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">duergar</a> encampment, near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murmath\" title=\"Murmath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Murmath.png/25px-Portrait_Murmath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Murmath.png/38px-Portrait_Murmath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Murmath.png/50px-Portrait_Murmath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Murmath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Murmath.png/25px-Portrait_Murmath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Portrait_Murmath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Murmath\" title=\"Murmath\">Murmath</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-632&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;388</span>\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When picked up, the active party members must pass a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 History Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/History\" title=\"History\">History</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> to recognize it as a <a href=\"/wiki/Harper\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Harper\">Harper</a> pin.</li>\n<li>It is possible to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a> on the executed drow to learn that she was a Harper named <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jhaam\" title=\"Jhaam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/25px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/38px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/50px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jhaam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png/25px-Portrait_Jhaam.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Portrait_Jhaam.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jhaam\" title=\"Jhaam\">Jhaam</a> who was sent from <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> to investigate the Cult of the Absolute, on orders of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/38px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/50px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a>.</li>\n<li>Though obtained in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, this pin fits into a hidden slot in a desk within <a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\">Elerrathin's Home</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>. Doing so grants passage to Jaheira's private headquarters in the basement and also converts this item into a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Harp-Shaped_Pin\" title=\"Harp-Shaped Pin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Harp-Shaped_Pin\" title=\"Harp-Shaped Pin\">Harp-Shaped Pin</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201803\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2681/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23336/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7956/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 940824/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.987      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.987      1 -total\n 35.47%   17.019     10 Template:Icon_text\n 29.14%   13.985     27 Template:Trim\n 24.04%   11.537      6 Template:Icon_link\n 17.03%    8.171      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 16.85%    8.085      4 Template:CharLink\n 13.72%    6.583     12 Template:Ifempty\n 13.16%    6.315      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.96%    5.740      1 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:25396-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201803 and revision id 279308. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}